{
 "duration": 111.181,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Day thirty one. The world learned to whisper.",
   "start": 0.45,
   "end": 3.297
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The buildings stood there like tall unanswered questions.",
   "start": 3.617,
   "end": 6.559
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Cold toast. Cold coffee. A phone that shouldn't work.",
   "start": 6.879,
   "end": 10.862
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 11.182,
   "end": 12.182
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Then it buzzed.",
   "start": 12.182,
   "end": 13.151
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "who": "Glitch",
   "text": "New rules. You'll want to break them.",
   "start": 13.471,
   "end": 16.773
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "No one was typing. No one was there.",
   "start": 17.093,
   "end": 19.794
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The rules came one by one, like footsteps on stairs.",
   "start": 20.113,
   "end": 23.627
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 23.947,
   "end": 24.947
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "One.",
   "start": 24.947,
   "end": 25.516
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Two buckets a day, boiled before you trust them.",
   "start": 26.016,
   "end": 28.892
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Clean water was about to become the only money.",
   "start": 29.212,
   "end": 32.143
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Two.",
   "start": 32.463,
   "end": 33.034
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Cash for bread. Cards already lied.",
   "start": 33.534,
   "end": 36.115
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Three.",
   "start": 36.435,
   "end": 37.075
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Sleep in shifts. Someone always watches the stairwell.",
   "start": 37.575,
   "end": 41.153
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Four.",
   "start": 41.473,
   "end": 42.125
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Chalk mark on the door when you're safe.",
   "start": 42.625,
   "end": 44.703
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The hallway built a quiet country out of chalk marks.",
   "start": 45.023,
   "end": 48.121
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 48.441,
   "end": 49.441
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Then, at nine, it changed its mind.",
   "start": 49.441,
   "end": 51.685
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "who": "Glitch",
   "text": "Good. Water stops at noon. All of it.",
   "start": 52.005,
   "end": 56.303
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "We laughed. Water is pipes.",
   "start": 56.623,
   "end": 58.917
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "At one minute to twelve, the pipes sang like kettles.",
   "start": 59.237,
   "end": 62.359
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "At noon, the song stopped.",
   "start": 62.679,
   "end": 64.242
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 64.562,
   "end": 66.062
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The tap gave nothing. Not water, not air.",
   "start": 66.062,
   "end": 68.974
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Then the ceiling knocked. Twice.",
   "start": 69.294,
   "end": 71.603
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "who": "Neighbor",
   "text": "Tell me your phone buzzed too.",
   "start": 71.922,
   "end": 73.937
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Two phones on the table. One message. Same second. Same length.",
   "start": 74.257,
   "end": 79.415
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The city had a rulebook, and its author was watching us read it.",
   "start": 79.735,
   "end": 83.431
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 83.751,
   "end": 84.951
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "who": "Glitch",
   "text": "The tower on Fourth still has water. For now.",
   "start": 84.951,
   "end": 89.166
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Dear phone. That is not a hint. That is a leash.",
   "start": 89.486,
   "end": 93.188
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Four blocks. No power. And a stranger who knows my floors.",
   "start": 93.508,
   "end": 98.222
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "who": "beat",
   "text": "",
   "start": 98.542,
   "end": 99.542
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "We packed the bags before we finished deciding.",
   "start": 99.542,
   "end": 102.104
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The stairwell smelled like a question all the way down.",
   "start": 102.424,
   "end": 105.567
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "It knows when the water stops. What else does it know?",
   "start": 105.887,
   "end": 109.261
  }
 ]
}